{
  "type": "mod",
  "id": 1371,
  "hub_id": 1895,
  "guid": "com.hazelify.environmentreplace",
  "name": "Environment Replace",
  "slug": "environment-replace",
  "teaser": "Replace the background and splash screen",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1895.png",
  "downloads": 5305,
  "favourites_count": 5,
  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3><strong>CHECK INSTALL TAB FOR REQUIRED DEPENDENCY!</strong></h3>\n<p>Replace splash screen: put videos (mp4, gif) or pictures (jpeg, png, webp, etc.) into the “splash” folder.</p>\n<p>Every game restart will have a randomly selected splash screen.</p>\n<p>The video volume can be adjusted in the BepInEx <strong>F12</strong> menu in-game.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/kgEvv1s.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kgEvv1s.png\" alt=\"kgEvv1s.png\" /></a></p>\n<p>Replace environment: put videos (mp4, gif) or pictures (jpeg, png, webp, etc.) into the “environment” folder.</p>\n<p>Every game restart will have a randomly selected wallpaper.</p>\n<p>(Download the above image <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1_A2S2NwDAwhfYfAjEWSOl--VUOFd7tnX/view?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here</a>)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1215-eft-api/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">THIS MOD REQUIRES EFTApi 1.1.4 or later - INSTALL IT FIRST</a></p>\n<p>Extract BepInEx folder from 7z to Game Root directory</p>\n<p>(Yes it’s QuestTracker, it works the same for this mod)</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Issue</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1215-eft-api/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">First, did you install EftApi? If not, install it.</a></h3>\n<h3>If nothing, create a support thread. Describe your game version, what other mods you have installed, and what error(s) you are getting. If possible, attach a link to your LogOutput.log</h3></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Support me</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Making and updating mods takes a lot of free time and energy.</p>\n<p>You can support <em><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/8197-kmyuhkyuk/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">kmyuhkyuhk</a></em> on one of the below websites, this keeps them motivated doing modding work for you</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://afdian.net/a/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AfDian (kmyuhkyuk)</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.buymeacoffee.com/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">BuymeaCoffee (kmyuhkyuk)</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://patreon.com/kmyuhkyuk\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Patreon (kmyuhkyuk)</a></p>\n<h4>link for myself</h4>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.paypal.me/whitehazel\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">PayPal (Devraccoon)</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Repost</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Please do not repost this work on other websites without kmyuhkyuk’s consent</p>\n<p>This mod is only released on the following sites:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://sns.oddba.cn/29679.html\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Oddba</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1895-environment-replace/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT Workshop</a></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/759-environment-replace/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SPT Workshop (updated version)</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
